#BlueJ class context
comment0.target=UiArt
comment0.text=\r\n\ UiArt\ -\ pe\u00E7as\ visuais\ da\ interface\ (pain\u00E9is,\ sombras).\r\n\r\n\ Os\ cantos\ s\u00E3o\ "cortados"\ em\ degraus\ para\ combinar\ com\ o\ estilo\ pixel\ art.\r\n
comment1.params=width\ height
comment1.target=greenfoot.GreenfootImage\ panel(int,\ int)
comment1.text=\r\n\ Painel\ semitransparente\ com\ borda\ clara.\r\n
comment2.params=width\ height\ edge
comment2.target=greenfoot.GreenfootImage\ panel(int,\ int,\ greenfoot.Color)
comment2.text=\r\n\ Painel\ semitransparente\ com\ a\ cor\ de\ borda\ escolhida.\r\n
comment3.params=image\ alpha
comment3.target=greenfoot.GreenfootImage\ dimmed(greenfoot.GreenfootImage,\ int)
comment3.text=\r\n\ Escurece\ uma\ imagem\ inteira\ (ex.\:\ fundo\ das\ telas\ de\ resultado,\r\n\ para\ o\ texto\ ficar\ em\ primeiro\ plano).\r\n
comment4.params=width
comment4.target=greenfoot.GreenfootImage\ shadow(int)
comment4.text=\r\n\ Sombra\ oval\ para\ colocar\ embaixo\ dos\ personagens.\r\n
comment5.params=sprite\ gap
comment5.target=greenfoot.GreenfootImage\ withShadow(greenfoot.GreenfootImage,\ int)
comment5.text=\r\n\ Junta\ uma\ imagem\ de\ personagem\ com\ uma\ sombra\ embaixo\ dela.\r\n\ gap\ \=\ espa\u00E7o\ entre\ os\ p\u00E9s\ e\ a\ sombra\ (personagens\ que\ flutuam).\r\n
comment6.params=sprite\ gap\ shadowWidth
comment6.target=greenfoot.GreenfootImage\ withShadow(greenfoot.GreenfootImage,\ int,\ int)
comment6.text=\r\n\ Igual\ ao\ anterior,\ escolhendo\ a\ largura\ da\ sombra\ (para\ que\ poses\r\n\ de\ larguras\ diferentes\ tenham\ a\ mesma\ sombra).\r\n
